    "output": "mod-pack features (sound: OFF):\n  ON   token-weather  Token Weather: context-window forecast above the prompt: band, percent, tokens, 12-turn chart [plays sound]\n  ON   cache-keeper  Cache Keeper: countdown of how long the prompt cache stays warm, with a compact button; costs no model tokens; lifetime 60 min by default (a subscription), set cacheTtlMinutes to 5 on an API key\n  ON   prompt-queue  Prompt Queue: type /q <text> while Claude works to queue follow-up prompts; they send one at a time when a turn ends; costs no model tokens itself; queued prompts run with your permissions\n  OFF  wait-what  Wait What: plain-words retell of each long answer in the band; SPENDS model tokens: one short reply from the cheapest model per answer, at most maxModelCallsPerHour an hour (default 30); OFF by default [uses model tokens]\n  ON   blast-radius  Blast Radius: asks Proceed or Cancel before a risky shell command (rm -rf, git reset --hard, git push --force, ...); costs no model tokens\n  ON   ship-gate  Ship Gate: asks Proceed or Cancel, with a check for personal info, before git push, gh repo create and Pages; denies git commit of code when no test passed since the last edit; costs no model tokens\n  ON   snake  Snake: type /snake to play Snake in a pane; it pauses when Claude finishes and goes on when you send the next prompt; keys w a s d p r work while the pane has the keyboard; costs no model tokens\n\nType /mods help for the commands."
